      "message": "Dear Professor Alvarez,\n\nThank you for reaching out and for your interest in having someone from our team speak with your graduate seminar. It is great to hear that your students are already experimenting with Jaseci.\n\nWe would be delighted to deliver a 60-minute guest lecture on agentic programming for your AI systems seminar. September 22 works best for our team, and we are happy to present remotely during your 2-4pm Eastern session. We will plan for a focused 60-minute talk with time for questions and discussion.\n\nPlease let us know if there are any particular topics or themes you would like us to emphasize, and we will coordinate logistics as the date approaches.\n\nBest regards,\nThe Jaseci Team\nimpact@jaseci.org"
